## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to combine tenancy isolation with policy-as-code, Sentinel, and automation in a real Vault Enterprise onboarding scenario.

## Key Concepts
- Vault namespaces and per-tenant isolation
- AppRole bindings and per-tenant policies
- DB secret engine roles with short TTLs
- Terraform provisioning and Sentinel gate checks

## Code Example
```javascript
// Terraform-like snippet (pseudo)
provider "vault" { address = "https://vault.example" }

resource "vault_namespace" "tenant" {
  path = "ns-tenant-1"
}

resource "vault_policy" "tenant1" {
  name   = "tenant-1-policy"
  policy = <<POL
path "ns-tenant-1/secret/**" {
  capabilities = ["read","list"]
}
path "db/secret/tenant-1/**" {
  capabilities = ["read","create","update"]
}
POL
}

resource "vault_approle_auth_backend_role" "tenant1" {
  backend        = "approle"
  role_name      = "tenant-1-app"
  token_ttl      = "2m"
  token_max_ttl  = "2m"
  token_policies = ["tenant-1-policy"]
}
```

```javascript
// Sentinel-like policy (conceptual)
import "http"

allowed_paths = [
  "ns-tenant-*/secret/**",
  "db/secret/tenant-*/**"
]

main = rule {
  request.path in allowed_paths and request.namespace matches namespace
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test Sentinel drift and rollback in a live cluster?
- What metrics would you monitor during onboarding to catch isolation breaches early?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests advanced operational mastery: scaling secret provisioning across thousands of tenants, safely rotating encryption keys with minimal disruption, and preserving strict isolation with auditable trails.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-tenant isolation and namespace scoping
- Automated secret rotation (Transit keys) with zero-downtime
- AppRole bindings per-tenant and per-app scope
- Rollback and audit integration during rotations

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-rotation orchestrator sketch
async function rotateTenantKeys(tenant) {
  await rotateTransitKey(tenant);
  await rebindAppRoles(tenant);
  await validateTenantTraffic(tenant);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you monitor rotation health and incident response?
- What tests would you automate to ensure no cross-tenant leakage post-rotation?
